  "title": "Rocky Road Cake",
  "description": "This is a chocolate &#39;crazy&#39; cake with a nice chocolate-marshmallow frosting. The cake is mixed in the pan that it is baked in, and contains no eggs or dairy.",
  "authors": [
    "Angela"
  ],
